#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:19 src/Lib/AdminSettingsView.php:68
msgid "Firewall"
msgstr "Firewall"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:20
msgid "Checks requests before WordPress handles them and hides details that attackers look for. The request filter is in beta."
msgstr "Prüft Anfragen, bevor WordPress sie verarbeitet, und verbirgt Details, nach denen Angreifer suchen. Der Anfragefilter ist in der Beta-Phase."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:28
msgid "Blocks requests that contain common attack patterns such as code injection and cross-site scripting. The patterns are on the Advanced tab."
msgstr "Blockiert Anfragen mit verbreiteten Angriffsmustern wie Code-Injection und Cross-Site-Scripting. Die Muster finden Sie im Tab Erweitert."

