#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:44
msgid "Close the REST API to visitors"
msgstr "REST API für Besucher schließen"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:45
msgid "Visitors who are not logged in cannot read posts, pages, users or settings through /wp-json/wp/v2/. The API index and the endpoints of other plugins stay open."
msgstr "Nicht angemeldete Besucher können über /wp-json/wp/v2/ keine Beiträge, Seiten, Benutzer oder Einstellungen lesen. Der API-Index und die Endpunkte anderer Plugins bleiben offen."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:61
msgid "Hide usernames from visitors"
msgstr "Benutzernamen vor Besuchern verbergen"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:62
msgid "Stops the common ways to find login names: ?author=1 links, the REST users list, administrators in the users sitemap and oEmbed author data. Author pages keep working."
msgstr "Unterbindet die üblichen Wege, Anmeldenamen herauszufinden: ?author=1-Links, die REST-Benutzerliste, Administratoren in der Benutzer-Sitemap und oEmbed-Autorendaten. Autorenseiten funktionieren weiterhin."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:78
msgid "Hide server and PHP versions"
msgstr "Server- und PHP-Versionen verbergen"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:79
msgid "Removes the Server and X-Powered-By response headers that reveal software versions."
msgstr "Entfernt die Antwort-Header Server und X-Powered-By, die Softwareversionen verraten."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:95
msgid "Block bad bots"
msgstr "Schädliche Bots blockieren"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:96
msgid "Blocks requests whose user agent matches the bad bot list (by default libwww-perl)."
msgstr "Blockiert Anfragen, deren User-Agent zur Liste schädlicher Bots passt (standardmäßig libwww-perl)."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:112
msgid "Send browser security headers"
msgstr "Browser-Sicherheits-Header senden"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:113
msgid "Sends X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options and Referrer-Policy. Content Security Policy and HSTS have their own settings."
msgstr "Sendet X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options und Referrer-Policy. Content Security Policy und HSTS haben eigene Einstellungen."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:129
msgid "Isolate pages from other windows (COOP)"
msgstr "Seiten von anderen Fenstern isolieren (COOP)"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:130
msgid "Sends Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin. This blocks some cross-site leaks but breaks sign-in pop-ups such as \"Sign in with Google\". Leave it off if you use them."
msgstr "Sendet Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin. Das verhindert einige Cross-Site-Lecks, bricht aber Anmelde-Pop-ups wie „Über Google anmelden“. Lassen Sie es aus, wenn Sie solche verwenden."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:145
msgid "Maximum request size"
msgstr "Maximale Anfragegröße"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:147
msgid " bytes"
msgstr " Bytes"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:147
msgid "Larger requests from visitors (file uploads excluded) are written to the Security Log. 0 turns the check off. Default: 4096."
msgstr "Größere Anfragen von Besuchern (ohne Datei-Uploads) werden im Sicherheitsprotokoll vermerkt. 0 schaltet die Prüfung aus. Standard: 4096."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:153
msgid "Block oversized requests"
msgstr "Zu große Anfragen blockieren"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:154
msgid "Check the Security Log first."
msgstr "Prüfen Sie zuerst das Sicherheitsprotokoll."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:154
msgid "Long comments and checkout forms can go over the limit. A blocked address cannot open any page of this site until the block ends."
msgstr "Lange Kommentare und Bestellformulare können das Limit überschreiten. Eine blockierte Adresse kann bis zum Ende der Sperre keine Seite dieser Website öffnen."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:169
msgid "Oversized requests allowed"
msgstr "Erlaubte zu große Anfragen"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:171
msgid " requests"
msgstr " Anfragen"

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:171
msgid "An address is blocked when it reaches this many oversized requests within 10 minutes. A single request never blocks anyone unless this is 1. Default: 5."
msgstr "Eine Adresse wird gesperrt, wenn sie innerhalb von 10 Minuten so viele zu große Anfragen erreicht. Eine einzelne Anfrage sperrt niemanden, außer der Wert ist 1. Standard: 5."

#: src/Lib/AdminSections/ActiveGuardSettings.php:176
